-- args
format --stdin-file-path input.md --wrap sentence
-- stdin
Term sentence. ~ definition-looking prose. Last sentence.

Term sentence. ~word stays prose. Last sentence.

Term sentence. ~~struck text~~ stays prose. Last sentence.
-- stdout
Term sentence. ~ definition-looking prose.
Last sentence.

Term sentence.
~word stays prose.
Last sentence.

Term sentence.
~~struck text~~ stays prose.
Last sentence.
-- stderr
-- status
0
